This weekend, I want to invite my badminton friends Neha and Amit home for a meal.
I want to cook a Maharashtrian dish.
'Kande Pohe' is a very famous dish here.
But I do not know how to cook it.
So, I open my laptop.
I search for a cooking video on the internet.
Quickly, I find a good video.
In that video, a chef cooks Kande Pohe.
I watch and listen to the video carefully.
The chef gives cooking instructions in sequence.
He says, "First, take half a kilo of poha."
"Then, wash it well in water."
"After that, chop the onion into small pieces."
The chef says again, "Heat two spoons of oil in a pan."
I understand all his instructions clearly.
This sequence for cooking is very simple.
I have confidence that I can cook this.
Now I write the list of items for the shop.
